    "statement": "The plane the catalog came from and the plane its Rust column is about. It is fetch-only from here: this document reads it and never writes to it. Its columns below (directory, library name, declaration lines) are recorded provenance read at the commit named above; they are NOT recomputed by the verifier, because a checkout is not required to have the ref fetched. Everything this document says about THIS plane is recomputed on every run."
  },
