    "note": "Both denominators are anchored to the same digest-pinned Java-WebSocket archive, which is what makes the Java-construct join legitimate. They are not anchored to it with the same resolution: the catalog gives all 24 java_bindings one whole-archive digest, so its Java column distinguishes no two obligations by content, while the proof-target plan gives its Java authority per-file digests and file:line spans."
